{
  "body": "This term \"tinea unguium\" refers to a fungal infection of the nails. However, the exact synonyms include infections of various other body parts. These seem to have been added by mistake.\n\nFor example:\ncellulitis and abscess of buttock\ncellulitis and abscess of face\ncellulitis and abscess of gluteal region\ncellulitis and abscess of trunk\ncellulitis and abscess of upper arm and forearm",
  "comments": [
    {
