      "author": {
        "login": "matentzn"
      },
      "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
      "body": "This will be a tough nut to crack in the big picture. All of these come from DO, and are still in there:\n\nhttps://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/doid/classes/http%253A%252F%252Fpurl.obolibrary.org%252Fobo%252FDOID_13074\n\n@sabrinatoro what is your take? \n\n1. Fix these 1 by 1\n2. Do something drastic more large scale?\n",
